# Files that belong to the repository, not to the home directory it describes.
#
# chezmoi treats this source directory as a picture of $HOME, so anything not listed
# here becomes a target. Names beginning with a dot are chezmoi's own and are never
# applied, which covers .github but nothing else — without these entries an apply
# creates ~/LICENSE, ~/docs/ and ~/tests/. See docs/DESIGN.md §7.
#
# The markdown glob is deliberately broader than today's filenames: a document added
# later is then excluded by default rather than by remembering to come back here.
*.md
LICENSE
docs
docs/**
tests
tests/**
